# Optional WebRTC TURN relay configuration for 4G/5G mobile connectivity.
# Direct STUN works on most Wi-Fi networks, but mobile carrier CGNAT often
# requires a TURN relay (e.g. Cloudflare Calls TURN, Metered, or coturn).
#
# Option 1: JSON array of RTCIceServer entries
# VITE_ICE_SERVERS='[{"urls":["turn:turn.example.com:3478","turns:turn.example.com:5349"],"username":"your-user","credential":"your-pass"}]'
#
# Option 2: Single TURN server (comma-separated URLs supported)
# VITE_TURN_URL=turn:turn.example.com:3478,turns:turn.example.com:5349
# VITE_TURN_USERNAME=your-user
# VITE_TURN_CREDENTIAL=your-pass
